		{"id":"a01f3dc1abbcd412","type":"text","text":"```\nConnection shuru karne ke liye use hota hai. Jab client ko server se baat karni hoti hai, toh pehla SYN packet bhejta hai (Three-way handshake ka pehla step)\n```","x":60,"y":735,"width":781,"height":110},
		{"id":"19cd4aff1b254de4","type":"text","text":"```\nYeh signal deta hai ki packet ke andar ka kuch data baki data se zyada zaroori hai aur ise pehle process kiya jaye.\n```","x":60,"y":219,"width":781,"height":101},
		{"id":"591763afb600391a","type":"text","text":"```\nYeh batane ke liye hota hai ki data/packet theek se mil gaya hai. Handshake ya data transfer ke dauran har valid packet ke sath yeh set hota hai.\n```","x":60,"y":340,"width":781,"height":100},
		{"id":"2bed633d84382050","type":"text","text":"```\nConnection ko aaram se aur safely khatam (terminate) karne ki request karta hai jab sender ka sara data bheja ja chuka ho\n```","x":60,"y":460,"width":781,"height":100},
		{"id":"dcfbbd0cffa058d9","type":"text","text":"```\nConnection ko achanak (abruptly) aur turant tod deta hai. Agar koi error ho ya connection reject karna ho, tab yeh flag bheeja jata hai. Cyber security mein XMAS ya Null scans iska galat use karte hain\n```","x":60,"y":580,"width":781,"height":140},
		{"id":"c06ff3a1e9e66126","type":"text","text":"```\nConnection ko aaram se aur safely khatam (terminate) karne ki request karta hai jab sender ka sara data bheja ja chuka ho\n```","x":60,"y":855,"width":781,"height":110},
