		{"id":"c21926b29a555a10","type":"text","text":"Lekin agar tum ICMP packets banana chahte ho (bilkul `ping` ki tarah), to usko batana padta hai:\n\n```\n-1 = ICMP\n```","x":1590,"y":1244,"width":303,"height":167},
