		{"id":"6641c6370118c04a","type":"text","text":"- RustScan\n- NetscanTool Pro\n- sx\n- MegaPing\n- Solar winds engineers\n- PRTG network","x":-122,"y":3780,"width":242,"height":197},
		{"id":"d040ceb4ddfec239","type":"text","text":"# Firewall Behavior Notes\n\n## 1. Firewall OFF (No Firewall)\n\n### Port OPEN\n\n- Request send hota hai.\n    \n- Service request receive karti hai.\n    \n- Service response bhejti hai.\n    \n- Result: OPEN\n    \n\nExample:\n\nTCP:\n\n```\nSYN  -------->\n      <-------- SYN + ACK\n```\n\n---\n\n### Port CLOSED\n\n- Request send hota hai.\n    \n- Host reachable hota hai.\n    \n- Lekin service available nahi hoti.\n    \n- Host reject response bhejta hai.\n    \n\nResponse:\n\nTCP:\n\n```\nRST Packet\n```\n\nUDP:\n\n```\nICMP Port Unreachable\n```\n\nResult:\n\n```\nCLOSED\n```\n\n---\n\n# 2. Firewall ON Behavior\n\n## Firewall Allow (ACCEPT)\n\n- Firewall packet ko allow karta hai.\n    \n- Packet service tak pahuchta hai.\n    \n- Service reply bhejti hai.\n    \n- Normal response milta hai.\n    \n\nResult:\n\n```\nOPEN\n```\n\n---\n\n## Firewall DROP (Silent Blocking)\n\n- Firewall packet ko silently delete kar deta hai.\n    \n- Koi response nahi bhejta.\n    \n- Sender wait karta hai.\n    \n- Timeout hota hai.\n    \n\nFlow:\n\n```\nPacket\n   |\n   v\nFirewall\n   |\n   X\nDropped\n```\n\nResult:\n\n```\nFILTERED\n```\n\n---\n\n## Firewall REJECT\n\n- Firewall packet ko block karta hai.\n    \n- Lekin sender ko error response bhejta hai.\n    \n\nResponse:\n\nTCP:\n\n```\nRST Packet\n```\n\nUDP:\n\n```\nICMP Error Message\n```\n\nResult:\n\n```\nBlocked / Closed\n```\n\n---\n\n# Firewall ke Main Actions\n\n## 1. ACCEPT\n\n- Packet allow karta hai.\n    \n- Traffic pass hota hai.\n    \n- Normal response milta hai.\n    \n\n## 2. DROP\n\n- Packet silently discard karta hai.\n    \n- Koi reply nahi deta.\n    \n- Timeout hota hai.\n    \n\n## 3. REJECT\n\n- Packet block karta hai.\n    \n- Error message bhejta hai.\n    \n\n## 4. LOG\n\n- Packet information record karta hai.\n    \n- Monitoring ke liye use hota hai.\n    \n\n## 5. RATE LIMIT\n\n- Traffic ko limit karta hai.\n    \n- Bahut zyada packets ko slow/drop kar sakta hai.\n    \n\n---\n\n# Firewall Scan Results\n\n## OPEN\n\nMeaning:\n\n- Port accessible hai.\n    \n- Service running hai.\n    \n- Response mil raha hai.\n    \n\nResponse:\n\n```\nRequest → Reply\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLOSED\n\nMeaning:\n\n- Host alive hai.\n    \n- Port par service nahi chal rahi.\n    \n\nResponse:\n\nTCP:\n\n```\nRST\n```\n\nUDP:\n\n```\nICMP Port Unreachable\n```\n\n---\n\n## FILTERED\n\nMeaning:\n\n- Firewall ya filter packet ko block kar raha hai.\n    \n\nResponse:\n\n```\nRequest → No Response → Timeout\n```\n\n---\n\n## OPEN|FILTERED (Mostly UDP)\n\nMeaning:\n\n- Response nahi mila.\n    \n- Port open ho sakta hai.\n    \n- Firewall drop bhi kar sakta hai.\n    \n\n---\n\n# UDP Scan Responses\n\n## UDP Reply\n\n- Port OPEN\n    \n- Service active\n    \n\n## ICMP Port Unreachable\n\n- Host alive\n    \n- UDP port CLOSED\n    \n\n## No Response\n\n- Port OPEN ho sakta hai.\n    \n- Firewall DROP kar sakta hai.\n    \n- Result: OPEN|FILTERED\n    \n\n## ICMP Prohibited\n\n- Firewall ne block kiya.\n    \n\n## Network Unreachable\n\n- Routing ya network problem.\n    \n\n## Host Unreachable\n\n- Target host tak nahi pahuch raha.\n    \n\n---\n\n# Quick Memory Trick\n\n```\nReply mila\n= OPEN\n\nRST / ICMP Error\n= CLOSED\n\nNo Reply\n= FILTERED\n\nICMP Prohibited\n= Firewall Block\n```\n\n# Firewall ke 3 Basic Behaviors\n\n1. ACCEPT\n    \n    - Allow traffic\n        \n2. DROP\n    \n    - Silently block traffic\n        \n3. REJECT\n    \n    - Block + error response","x":-1920,"y":-690,"width":560,"height":5920},
		{"id":"32fd53c48dbb5b15","x":1160,"y":1185,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Host Discovery -> machine live hai ya nahi"},
		{"id":"b08744c76eacb7c3","x":-782,"y":1570,"width":364,"height":228,"type":"text","text":"| Tumhe kya check karna hai | Flag      |\n| ------------------------- | --------- |\n| Normal TCP port open hai? | `-S`      |\n| Firewall hai ya nahi?     | `-A`      |\n| Stealth scan              | `-F`      |\n| Hidden TCP scan           | NULL/Xmas |\n| UDP port                  | `-2`      |\n| Ping check                | `-1`      |\n"},
		{"id":"278cffb5a3e74a96","x":-1320,"y":900,"width":1010,"height":310,"type":"text","text":"| Situation                                                  | Kaunsa scan/flag use karo    | Kyu                                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| Pehli baar kisi machine ke ports check karne hain          | **SYN Scan (`-S`)**          | Normal aur sabse reliable              |\n| Pata karna hai kaun se TCP ports open hain                 | **SYN (`-S`)**               | Open/closed ka best indication         |\n| Firewall beech me hai ya packet filter ho raha hai         | **ACK (`-A`)**               | Firewall rules samajhne ke liye        |\n| IDS/Firewall se bachne ka behavior test karna hai (lab me) | **FIN (`-F`) / NULL / Xmas** | Different TCP responses dekhne ke liye |\n| UDP service check karni hai (DNS, SNMP, DHCP etc.)         | **UDP (`-2`)**               | UDP ports ke liye                      |\n| Sirf machine alive hai ya nahi check karni hai             | **ICMP (`-1`)**              | Host discovery                         |\n| Web server check karna hai                                 | **SYN (`-S`) port 80/443**   | HTTP/HTTPS TCP par chalte hain         |\n| SSH check karna hai                                        | **SYN (`-S`) port 22**       | SSH TCP service hai                    |\n| DNS check karna hai                                        | **UDP (`-2`) port 53**       | DNS mostly UDP use karta hai           |\n"}
	],
